    "detailed_description": "The Game of Unknown is a survival horror game where the object is simple: spend the night in the old, abandoned school as a result of a dare. No harm, no foul.<br><br>Turns out you lost a bet and were dared to spend the night in the abandoned Elshwood Community School. However, upon arriving in the dead of night, you soon realize this place is anything but. As much as you don't want to believe it, something IS here...<br><br>Objects can be picked up and used to your advantage. From a basic box to a little lamp, never know what you can find here.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/64ddd8eca5f534c4e6308da0394dca72.poster.avif?t=1677034997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/64ddd8eca5f534c4e6308da0394dca72.webm?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/64ddd8eca5f534c4e6308da0394dca72.mp4?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Several rooms can give you access to areas that may contain useful items, or just a temporary hiding place...<br><br>There are also many interesting items laying about in this so-called decommissioned building...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/65b6f1ce11ac014f43848d71e1f5f132.poster.avif?t=1677034997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/65b6f1ce11ac014f43848d71e1f5f132.webm?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/65b6f1ce11ac014f43848d71e1f5f132.mp4?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use your short supply of items given to you to make it till the sun rises, because you defiantly don't want to come face-to-face with what's in store...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/0741388efb85762f5ddb22a8e4b5399b.poster.avif?t=1677034997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/0741388efb85762f5ddb22a8e4b5399b.webm?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/0741388efb85762f5ddb22a8e4b5399b.mp4?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>FEAR THE UNKNOWN</strong><br><br>(This game will receive content updates)",
    "about_the_game": "The Game of Unknown is a survival horror game where the object is simple: spend the night in the old, abandoned school as a result of a dare. No harm, no foul.<br><br>Turns out you lost a bet and were dared to spend the night in the abandoned Elshwood Community School. However, upon arriving in the dead of night, you soon realize this place is anything but. As much as you don't want to believe it, something IS here...<br><br>Objects can be picked up and used to your advantage. From a basic box to a little lamp, never know what you can find here.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/64ddd8eca5f534c4e6308da0394dca72.poster.avif?t=1677034997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/64ddd8eca5f534c4e6308da0394dca72.webm?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/64ddd8eca5f534c4e6308da0394dca72.mp4?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Several rooms can give you access to areas that may contain useful items, or just a temporary hiding place...<br><br>There are also many interesting items laying about in this so-called decommissioned building...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/65b6f1ce11ac014f43848d71e1f5f132.poster.avif?t=1677034997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/65b6f1ce11ac014f43848d71e1f5f132.webm?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/65b6f1ce11ac014f43848d71e1f5f132.mp4?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use your short supply of items given to you to make it till the sun rises, because you defiantly don't want to come face-to-face with what's in store...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/0741388efb85762f5ddb22a8e4b5399b.poster.avif?t=1677034997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/0741388efb85762f5ddb22a8e4b5399b.webm?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938220/extras/0741388efb85762f5ddb22a8e4b5399b.mp4?t=1677034997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>FEAR THE UNKNOWN</strong><br><br>(This game will receive content updates)",
    "short_description": "The Game of Unknown is a survival horror game where you must last in an abandoned school until the sun rises. How hard could it be?",
